## guide

guide-add-folder-body = Add a folder of photos; Kairos organizes them in place and copies nothing.
guide-back = Back
guide-back-body = Returns to the previous page, exactly where you were.
guide-ch-faces = Face Recognition
guide-ch-faces-intro = Kairos finds faces in the background and groups them into people. You just confirm and name them.
guide-ch-map = Map Controls
guide-ch-map-intro = The map is a real globe. Photos with a location cluster on it by place.
guide-ch-search = Search
guide-ch-search-intro = Search understands what’s in your photos, not just file names.
guide-ch-shortcuts = Keyboard Shortcuts
guide-ch-shortcuts-intro = You can drive almost all of Kairos from the keyboard. Shortcuts apply where the cursor is.
guide-deselect = Deselect
guide-deselect-body = The first Esc clears the selection, the next goes back from a subpage.
guide-dismiss-hint = Click anywhere or press Esc
guide-duplicates-body = Near-identical shots side by side – keep the better one, the other goes to the Trash (Ctrl + Z undoes).
guide-favorite = Favorite
guide-favorite-body = Adds the selected photos to Favorites, or removes them.
guide-frame-step = Frame by Frame
guide-frame-step-body = Step one frame back or forward.
guide-fullscreen = Full Screen
guide-fullscreen-body = Esc then closes full screen, the Info panel, and finally the viewer.
guide-globe-flyover = Globe and Flyover
guide-globe-flyover-body = Clicking a photo cluster flies into the landscape with a tilted camera. The Globe button or Esc takes you back.
guide-info-body = Panel with the date, place, camera, and people in the photo.
guide-journey-body = A cinematic replay of a trip, stop by stop, with polaroids and a film strip. Start it from an event card or with the Journey button on the map.
guide-journey-from-event = Journey from an Event
guide-journey-from-event-body = Plays the selected event’s Journey on the map.
guide-memories = Memories
guide-memories-body = When you have photos from the same day in past years, an “On This Day” card appears above the grid.
guide-merge = Merge Two People
guide-merge-body = Ctrl + click selects several cards, then press Merge. A merge can be undone.
guide-name-people-body = Open a card in People and enter a name. Named people act as anchors – more photos get matched to them more precisely.
guide-open-anywhere-body = Opens this page from anywhere.
guide-open-photo = Open Photo
guide-open-photo-body = Opens the selected photo in the viewer.
guide-play = Play
guide-play-body = Plays or pauses videos and Live Photos.
guide-prev-next = Previous and Next
guide-prev-next-body = Flip through photos in the viewer.
guide-regroup = Regroup
guide-regroup-body = When people get mixed up, regrouping sorts them again; confirmed people stay.
guide-search-body = Try “sunset”, “dog on the beach”, or “mountains in winter”. The model takes a moment to load the first time, then search is instant.
guide-seek-body = Skip back and forward in a video; Shift + ← / → works the same.
guide-show-me = Show Me
guide-show-me-tooltip = Goes to the place in the app and highlights it
guide-slideshow-body = Starts a full-screen slideshow from the selected photo.
guide-subtitle = Kairos Spark · short tips to get more out of your library
guide-terrain = 3D Terrain
guide-terrain-body = Zoom into the landscape and 3D terrain turns on by itself; on the globe it turns off to keep the map fast.
guide-three-layers = Three Map Styles
guide-three-layers-body = Standard, Satellite, and Outdoor (contours and marked trails) – the switch is right on the map.
guide-tile-size = Tile Size
guide-tile-size-body = Ctrl + mouse wheel or a touchpad pinch works too.
guide-tip-a11y = Tip: { $title }. { $body }
guide-title = Tips & Guide
guide-uncertain = Uncertain Faces
guide-uncertain-body = Faces Kairos isn’t sure about – go through them quickly with yes / no.
guide-undo = Undo a Decision
guide-undo-body = In duplicate review and uncertain faces, undoes the last step.
guide-where-grid = Photo Grid
guide-where-help = Help
guide-where-viewer = Viewer
guide-ymd = Years, Months, Days
guide-ymd-body = The switch above the grid jumps through time – click a year to open its months, click a month to jump to that spot in the grid.
key-space = Space
nav-events = Events

